  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "一张可欣赏风景的桌子",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/21967",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=21967",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"21967\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这张户外用桌和两张折叠椅非常适合放在小阳台，作为基本的家具布置。更重要的是，它们的价格很实惠，这样你不用花大价钱，就能在阳台拓展更多的生活空间。",
    "一张可欣赏风景的桌子"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/7a9fd6373a06f73e/original/PH183339.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/21967",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/7a9fd6373a06f73e/original/PH183339.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一扇敞开的门，通向了郁郁葱葱的阳台。阳台上有一张白色的FEJAN 菲阳 桌子和两张椅子，上面的墙上挂着一盏提灯。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/7a9fd6373a06f73e/original/PH183339.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
